  "routes": "every trade pays the pool once: alternate routers, the bare mainnet Universal Router (V4_SWAP only, no payment command) and programmable.market's router with the swap only; an idea share left unclaimed for a day buys back and burns the main token through the main token's pool, paying the platform share there once; nothing reaches the platform recipient outside the vaults",
